,"issue_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/comments{/number}","contents_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/contents/{+path}","compare_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/compare/{base}...{head}","merges_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/merges","archive_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/{archive_format}{/ref}","downloads_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/downloads","issues_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues{/number}","pulls_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/pulls{/number}","milestones_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/milestones{/number}","notifications_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/deployments","created_at":"2020-01-16T03:59:20Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T17:25:44Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T23:01:56Z","git_url":"git://github.com/gofiber/fiber.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:gofiber/fiber.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/gofiber/fiber.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/gofiber/fiber","homepage":"https://gofiber.io","size":234739,"stargazers_count":38715,"watchers_count":38715,"language":"Go","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":false,"forks_count":1923,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":76,"license":{"key":"mit","name":"MIT License","spdx_id":"MIT","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/mit","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTEz"},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["express","expressjs","fast","fiber","flexible","framework","friendly","go","golang","hacktoberfest","hacktoberfest2020","nodejs","performance","rest-api","web"],"visibility":"public","forks":1923,"open_issues":76,"watchers":38715,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"🔥 **New**\r\n-\r\n- [ctx.Route().Params](https://docs.gofiber.io/ctx#route) are now public https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/545 @zerbitx\r\n- [app.Settings.UnescapePath](https://docs.gofiber.io/app#settings)\r\nConverts all encoded characters in the route back before setting the path for the context, so that the routing can also work with urlencoded special characters https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/506\r\n- Abstract [fiber.Router interface](https://godoc.org/github.com/gofiber/fiber#Router) for `App` & `Group` https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/476\r\n- [app.Settings.ReadBufferSize](https://docs.gofiber.io/app#settings)\r\nPer-connection buffer size for requests' reading. This also limits the maximum header size. Increase this buffer if your clients send multi-KB RequestURIs and/or multi-KB headers (for example, BIG cookies).\r\n- [app.Settings.WriteBufferSize](https://docs.gofiber.io/app#settings)\r\nPer-connection buffer size for responses' writing.\r\n- [app.Settings.Views](https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/blob/master/app.go#L181)\r\nWe added a new template interface named `Views`, [click here to see an example](https://github.com/gofiber/template#example).\r\n_The old Template interface is still backward compatible but it does not support the [new features](https://godoc.org/github.com/gofiber/template/html)_.\r\n- Add [Taiwanese translation](https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/blob/master/.github/README_zh-TW.md) https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/517\r\n- [c.Cookies(key string, defaultValue ...string)](https://docs.gofiber.io/ctx#cookies) pass an optional default value that returns if cookie is not found https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/541\r\n- [c.Params(key string, defaultValue ...string)](https://docs.gofiber.io/ctx#params) pass an optional default value that returns if param is not found https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/541\r\n- [c.Query(key string, defaultValue ...string)](https://docs.gofiber.io/ctx#query) pass an optional default value that returns if query is not found https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/541\r\n- Add more middleware test cases, coverage 84% https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/538\r\n<br>\r\n\r\n🧹 **Updates**\r\n-\r\n- The hyphen (`-`) and the dot (`.`) are now interpreted literally in paths, they can be used along with route parameters for useful purposes. Thank you @ReneWerner87 \r\n```go\r\n// http://localhost:3000/plantae/prunus.persica\r\napp.Get(\"/plantae/:genus.:species\", func(c *fiber.Ctx) {\r\n  c.Params(\"genus\")   // prunus\r\n  c.Params(\"species\") // persica\r\n})\r\n\r\n// http://localhost:3000/flights/LAX-SFO\r\napp.Get(\"/flights/:from-:to\", func(c *fiber.Ctx) {\r\n  c.Params(\"from\")   // LAX\r\n  c.Params(\"to\")     // SFO\r\n})\r\n```\r\n- [ctx.Render(tmpl string, values interface{}, layout ...string) error](https://docs.gofiber.io/ctx#render) https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/441\r\nNow supports an additional `layout string` argument. Special thanks to @bdtomlin\r\n- [gofiber/template](https://github.com/gofiber/template) bumped to `v1.5.0`\r\n- Add SECURITY.md https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/484\r\n- Remove unnecessary badges https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/483\r\n- [app.Prefork](https://docs.gofiber.io/app#settings) is now supported on Windows https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/502\r\n- `app.Handler` is now accessible https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/485 https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/504\r\n- StartupMessage is colorized and now contains more information\r\n![](https://i.imgur.com/uLuIQQd.png)\r\n- Improve router performance https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/518 https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/518 ❤️ @ReneWerner87 \r\n- Bump `gofiber/utils v0.0.9`\r\n- Add [benchmark charts](https://gofiber.github.io/fiber) for internal middleware tests\r\n- Improve `app.Listen` documentation https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/561\r\n- Improve code coverage https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/558 @kiyonlin \r\n- Emoji Commits are now default <https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/552>\r\n- Improve PT translation https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/553 @fsmiamoto \r\n- Optimize `MethodNotAllowed` process https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/563 @ReneWerner87 \r\n<br>\r\n\r\n🩹 **Fixes**\r\n-\r\n- Remove panic on invalid method override https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/493\r\n- Child procs will exit when killing the master process https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/501\r\n- Router will return a `405` when another method is available on the same path https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/492\r\n- Timeout settings have been clarified https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/500 and [middleware.Timeout](https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/blob/master/middleware/timeout.md) has been added https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/489\r\n- [app.Routes()](https://docs.gofiber.io/app#routes) returns the correct path endpoints\r\n- Fix typo in compress middleware https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/513\r\n- Avoid panic in `c.Subdomains` https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/475\r\n- Do not use normalized path https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/482\r\n- Fix unnecessary pass-throughs for groups https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/487\r\n- Fix `flag.Parse()` compatibility https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/469\r\n- Fix `SendFile` 304 cache behavior https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/516\r\n- Correct prefork flags https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/523/commits/518902d61145bf68d1f18f8d735af98895411127\r\n- Correct example typo https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/513\r\n- Default to 0.0.0.0 host addr if non is given ( docker had issue's with this ) https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/539\r\n- Allow Config files inside the default RequestID & Compress middleware initiators https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/537\r\n- Respond with `405` for `Use` cases https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/556\r\n- Hide the `-prefork-child` flag from `flag.Usage` https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/issues/522 https://github.com/gofiber/fiber/pull/542 @doingodswork \r\n<br>\r\n","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/416/reactions","total_count":16,"+1":4,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":9,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":2,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/416/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"actor":{"login":"kiyonlin","id":1214670,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTQ2NzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1214670?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin","html_url":"https://github.com/kiyonlin","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kiyonlin/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-07-11T01:03:05Z","updated_at":"2020-07-11T01:03:05Z","source":{"type":"issue","issue":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/580","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/580/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/gofiber/fiber/issues/580/comment